# Encrypted inner product of two short vectors.
#
# Imagine Alice has private features a = (a0, a1, a2)
# and Bob has public weights w = (3, 5, 2).
# Bob computes the dot product without ever seeing Alice's data.
#
# Run with:
#   homo circuit examples/inner_product.hcir \
#       -i a0=4 -i a1=2 -i a2=7

input a0
input a1
input a2

t0 = a0 * 3
t1 = a1 * 5
t2 = a2 * 2

s1 = t0 + t1
out = s1 + t2

return out
